-# Journey #1: User Onboarding Tests
-
-This directory contains regression tests for user onboarding flows.
-
-## Test Coverage
-
-### Discord Signup
-
-- ✅ **See signup with Discord button**: Verifies the Discord login button is visible and accessible
-- ⏸️ **Navigate to home page after signup**: Skipped - requires OAuth automation
-
-### Invitation Code
-
-- ✅ **Apply invitation code and see coins increase**: Fully implemented end-to-end test
-
-## Running These Tests
-
-```bash
-# Run all onboarding tests
-pnpm test:regression onboarding/
-
-# Run with headed browser
-pnpm test:regression onboarding/ --headed
-
-# Run with UI mode
-pnpm test:regression --ui onboarding/
-```
-
-## Test Details
-
-### Test 1: Discord Button Visibility ✅
-
-**What it tests:**
-
-- Navigates to test.gazai.io home page
-- Opens the login dialog
-- Verifies Discord login button exists and is visible
-- Checks button contains "Discord" text
-
-**Expected outcome:** Pass if Discord button is found
-
-**Video**: Recorded in `test-results/`
-
----
-
-### Test 2: Discord OAuth Flow ⏸️
-
-**Status:** Intentionally skipped
-
-**Why skipped:**
-
-- OAuth automation is complex
-- Requires test Discord account
-- Need to handle redirects and popups
-
-**Future options:**
-
-- Mock OAuth callback
-- Use test Discord credentials
-- Keep as manual test
-
----
-
-### Test 3: Invitation Code Redemption ✅
-
-**What it tests:**
-
-1. Login to test.gazai.io
-2. Capture initial coin balance from header
-3. Open user profile dropdown menu
-4. Click "Use invite code" option
-5. Enter invitation code in dialog
-6. Submit the form
-7. Verify coin balance increased
-
-**UI Components:**
-
-- `user-profile-button` - Dropdown trigger
-- `use-invite-code-button` - Menu item
-- `invite-code-input` - Code input field
-- `submit-invite-code-button` - Submit button
-- `token-balance-display` - Coin balance
-
-**Prerequisites:**
-
-- `TEST_INVITATION_CODE` set in `.env.regression`
-- Code must be valid and unused
-
-**Expected outcome:**
-
-- Coin balance increases after redemption
-- Test skips if no code provided
-
-**Video**: Full flow recorded
-
-## Environment Setup
-
-Required in `.env.regression`:
-
-```bash
-BASE_URL=https://test.gazai.io
-TEST_USER_EMAIL=e2e@gazai.io
-TEST_USER_PASSWORD=your_password
-TEST_INVITATION_CODE=your_valid_code
-```
-
-## Troubleshooting
-
-### Test skips with "TEST_INVITATION_CODE not set"
-
-**Solution**: Add code to `.env.regression`
-
-### Test fails: "Coin balance did not increase"
-
-**Cause**: Code already used
-**Solution**: Use fresh, unused invitation code
-
-### Discord button not found
-
-**Cause**: UI changed or selector incorrect
-**Solution**: Check `data-testid="auth-discord-button"` exists
