-## 🎯 Purpose
-
-This regression test suite is designed to:
-
-- Test against **test.gazai.io** (NOT localhost)
-- Validate user journeys from the regression test cases document
-- Run in isolation from existing E2E tests
-- Record all test executions with video
-- Be used in a separate CI/CD pipeline
-
-## 📁 Directory Structure
-
-```
-tests/regression/
-├── fixture.ts                          # Regression test fixtures and helpers
-├── onboarding/                         # Journey #1: User Onboarding
-│   ├── user-onboarding.spec.ts
-│   └── README.md
-├── canvas/                             # Journey #2: Canvas (coming soon)
-├── content-generation/                 # Journey #3 & #4: Content (coming soon)
-├── gazai-chan/                         # Journey #5: GAZAI Chan (coming soon)
